WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,080
You hide from me

2
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:06,560
I didn't hide, Mr. Shen

3
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,640
Why is your throat bitten like this?

4
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:11,370
I'm sick and have a sore throat. Are you afraid of me?

5
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,360
Where did this scar come from?

6
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:29,600
Or that bastard knife from Xiang Heng?

7
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:42,800
what are you doing

8
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:45,370
A call from someone who asked me to buy flowstones and deliver them in half an hour

9
00:00:45,370 --> 00:00:46,730
Ask me what I'm doing here instead
